abstract: >-
  Rigorously certified computation of Khinchin's constant to millions of
  decimal digits using an accelerated Bailey-Borwein-Crandall zeta
  series over FLINT/Arb ball arithmetic, with reference ports of the
  same algorithm in seventeen further languages.
